{"synopsis":"Saikyou no Level 0 -Kaiseki Sukiru de Kanzen Musou-, Absolute Domination at Level 0 Using My Analysis Skill, The Strongest at Level 0: Absolute Domination with the Analysis Skill, The Strongest Level 0 -Unrivaled with the Analysis Skill-, The Strongest Level 0 Absolute Supremacy Through Analysis Skills, 最強のレベル0 -解析スキルで完全無双-\n\n## Synopsis Absolute Domination at Level 0 with My Analysis Skill\n\nTiba-tiba muncul di Bumi dan menjerumuskan umat manusia ke dalam krisis yang belum pernah terjadi sebelumnya, “Binatang Malapetaka” mengubah segalanya. Itsuki Tenma, yang kehilangan orang tuanya karena monster-monster ini, dipilih sebagai “Awakener”—manusia yang dianugerahi kemampuan khusus.\n\nJob yang ia dapatkan setelah terbangun adalah “Rare Job” yang menentang semua akal sehat! Meskipun terjebak di \\[Level 0], kemampuannya adalah kekuatan curang yang memungkinkannya menganalisis kemampuan musuh dan memperkuat statistiknya sendiri tanpa batas.\n\nDidorong oleh dendam, Tenma mengincar gelar “Manusia Terkuat” dalam serial pertarungan supernatural berintensitas tinggi ini. Tirai dibuka sekarang!","alternative_title":"最強のレベル0 -解析スキルで完全無双-","author":"Rain","artist":"HNS Studio, Liezao","chapters":[{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"fd023de5-566d-4d66-acb3-761c18219dca","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"1e64b227-72bd-49e7-9853-ac0e5d1bb840","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-08-01"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"6eb5a811-244b-4671-a19c-ae6cedd3cbb2","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-07-20"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"d83476d3-0a79-46e0-bf6b-512b6f3148ec","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-07-11"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"a17d21be-48a4-4349-8463-44e43b44bda7","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-07-02"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"77096238-aba4-4758-aad1-e9b196ee6c4a","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-06-28"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"048a4e44-6fc4-4360-be12-97ef775bea